    <!-- Water: three.js's water addons (examples/water/water.as): an ocean
         (Water, Sky), a pool and a flow map stream (Water2), mirrors with
         rippled glass (Reflector, Refractor) and a tropical lagoon to dive
         into (Water2 with lagoon.wgsl over seabed.wgsl, undersurface.wgsl
         from below), picked and tuned from a Rive panel. The water
         textures are in examples/shared. -->

